  unitName: High Elf
  unitId: 30093
  unitNumber: 116
  description: A powerful elf that lives in the deep forest. Known as the forest's
    guardian, it doesn't age and has beautiful looks and a nearly eternal lifespan.
    It dislikes fighting and its immensely powerful magic is usually used for defense
    rather than offense. Although very conservative, a curious one may leave the
    forest with a human it is interested in.
  summonDesc: You're quite the genius.<br>I'm gushing with interest in you.<br>Please
    let me be your companion.
  fusionDesc: I will use my power for<br>you and the forest.
  evoDesc: I'm glad I came with you.<br>Please let me continue on <br>with you.
